# A small implementation of the O3DE build functions (cmake/LYWrappers.cmake, cmake/Gems.cmake,
# cmake/PAL.cmake, cmake/3rdParty.cmake) used by the CMakeLists.txt of O3DE's Gems and of the
# engine libraries this recipe builds with them (AtomCore, CryCommon, AzQtComponents,
# AzToolsFramework, ...), so those CMakeLists.txt are used unmodified.
#
# Like upstream, links are resolved once all targets are declared (LY_DELAYED_LINK). Unlike
# upstream, a target whose dependencies do not all exist (a 3rdParty package this recipe does not
# provide, an executable, an editor-only library when the editor is off, ...) is left out of the
# build instead of failing it. o3de_finalize() enables, installs and describes the rest in a
# manifest that the recipe's package_info() turns into Conan components.

